Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 19:01:08 +1030
Subject: [PATCH 51/62] Tests: the present thread's hand-off and timing

The mailbox between the emulation thread and the present thread (wakes,
coalesced posts, interface presents waited for, stopping), the planned and
precise waits, and the present clock as the present thread drives it: presents
every 16.7 ms however long the game's code runs after a flip, and a delay of
half a game frame plus the work to the flip.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
